NextSteps_Phase1{immediate_actions}:
1. Initialize_git_repository:
   - cd /Users/cobe/Projects/Request Website v2.0
   - git init
   - git add .
   - git commit -m "chore: initial project setup with folder structure and config"

2. CreateGitHubRepository:
   - Push_to_GitHub
   - Setup_deployment_via_Cloudflare_Pages_or_Vercel

3. Form_Backend_Decision:
   - Choose:Getform.io_vs_CloudflareWorker_vs_GoogleAppsScript
   - Document_choice_in_config/forms-config.yaml

4. Analytics_Provider_Decision:
   - Choose:Plausible_vs_GA4_vs_Fathom
   - Document_choice_in_config/analytics-config.yaml

5. Create_Base_HTML:
   - Create_src/pages/index.html_with_meta_tags,Open_Graph,structured_data
   - Create_src/pages/404.html_error_page
   - Test_W3C_validation

6. Create_Base_CSS:
   - Create_src/css/variables.css_from_site-config.yaml
   - Create_src/css/reset.css_or_normalize
   - Create_src/css/base.css_typography,spacing
   - Create_src/css/sections.css_layout_templates
   - Create_src/css/forms.css_input+button_styles
   - Create_src/css/responsive.css_media_queries
   - Create_src/css/index.css_main_entry_point_(imports_all)

7. Setup_LocalServer:
   - python3 -m http.server 5500 --directory src
   - Visit_http://localhost:5500

8. CreateFirstPullRequest:
   - Branch:feature/phase-1-base-files
   - Include:index.html,404.html,base_CSS_files
   - Request_review,merge_to_main

